      <data key="d0">Page 6 Reference (discarded)</data>
      <data key="d1">discarded</data>
      <data key="d2">A reference or footnote from Page 6 discussing self-attention mechanisms, likely related to the advantages of self-attention layers over recurrent and convolutional layers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7c25c34bd5db5ed038dc5376e05808f1</data>
      <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763816166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Learning Rate Schedule for Transformer (equation)">
      <data key="d0">Learning Rate Schedule for Transformer (equation)</data>
      <data key="d1">equation</data>
      <data key="d2">The equation defines a learning rate schedule that balances exploration and exploitation in the early stages of training, allowing the model to adapt quickly to new information while avoiding overfitting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f49f2fe611ff61e81a710945d514e610</data>
      <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763816166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Page Number Reference (discarded)">
      <data key="d0">Page Number Reference (discarded)</data>
      <data key="d1">discarded</data>
      <data key="d2">A page number reference likely indicating a continuation of the discussion on machine translation models, possibly referring back to Table 2 for specific results and comparisons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67b843c9f1b1a287252e5b35c5af98fe</data>
      <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763816166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Machine Translation Model Comparison (table)">
      <data key="d0">Machine Translation Model Comparison (table)</data>
      <data key="d1">table</data>
      <data key="d2">This table compares different machine translation models, including their BLEU scores and training costs. The Transformer model outperforms previous state-of-the-art models on both English-to-German and English-to-French translation tasks at a fraction of the training cost.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b058fa89a51aff08c052de31411b61df</data>
      <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1763816166</data>
    </node>
