      <data key="d1">discarded</data>
      <data key="d2">A reference table providing estimated floating-point operations per second (TFLOPS) for different types of GPUs used in training, likely used to support the discussion on computational resources and model training costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c8b619dfa81c0106861fd63e391900e3</data>
